          "message": {
            "text": "Studio launches as its own local application instead of extending SVG Scrubber. A supplied project narrows the default workspace to its directory, while both the dedicated binary and the main CLI subcommand enter this same server/client surface. Scrubber therefore remains independently usable and later preview integration can reuse it through an explicit boundary.",
            "markdown": "Studio launches as its own local application instead of extending SVG Scrubber. A supplied project narrows the default workspace to its directory, while both the dedicated binary and the main CLI subcommand enter this same server/client surface. Scrubber therefore remains independently usable and later preview integration can reuse it through an explicit boundary."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/cli/studio.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 41,
                  "endLine": 52,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  const suppliedProject = positionals[0] == null ? null : resolve(positionals[0]);\n  const workspaceRoot = resolve(values.workspace ?? (suppliedProject == null ? process.cwd() : dirname(suppliedProject)));\n  const initialProjectPath = suppliedProject == null ? undefined : basename(suppliedProject);\n  const server = await startStudioServer({\n    port: parsePort(values.port),\n    workspaceRoot,\n    initialProjectPath,\n    log: (message) => process.stderr.write(`${message}\\n`),\n  });\n\n  process.stdout.write(`\\n  Domotion Studio running at ${server.url}\\n  Workspace: ${server.workspaceRoot}\\n  Press Ctrl-C to stop.\\n\\n`);\n  if (!values[\"no-open\"]) await openInBrowser(server.url);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
